// How the Japanese names that hold kanji read, kanji in hiragana and the rest as written,
// by the same keys as `../ja.ron`: shown with a name (Shift over an item, or above it). A
// template's reading fills `{name}` with its family's reading, or the family's name when
// that has no kanji. A mod adds its own `lang/readings/ja.ron` beside its `lang/ja.ron`.
